Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 python3 (>= 3.11),
 python3-activitytrack (>= 0.9.4~beta2),
 python3-pyqt6,
 qt6-qpa-plugins
Recommends: qt6-translations-l10n, qt6-wayland
Description: tray application of ActivityTrack for the PC
 ActivityTrack Desktop keeps the running activities and the to-dos of the
 ActivityTrack app a click away from the system tray, so that an activity
 goes in from the keyboard instead of the phone. It is paired with the
 organisation's ActivityTrack Web server like a phone and syncs both ways;
 without a network it keeps working and syncs when the network is back.
 .
 It runs on KDE Plasma and XFCE, on Wayland and X11.
